---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about Aura Living LLC's thoughtful, resident-minded approach to Virginia property support." path="/about/">
  <PageHero eyebrow="About Aura Living LLC" title="A more human standard for property care." intro="Aura Living LLC is a Virginia-focused property management company built around clear communication, careful coordination, and respect for home." />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-grid">
      <div class="content-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">What guides us</span>
        <h2>Care is in the details.</h2>
        <p>A well-cared-for property is more than a checklist. It is an owner who understands what is happening, a resident who knows where to turn, and a team that follows through on the small things.</p>
        <p>That is the standard Aura Living LLC is working toward. We keep our communication clear, our process practical, and our attention on the people and homes behind every request.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="side-card"><h2>Thoughtful by design.</h2><p>Calm does not mean passive. It means the details are organized well enough for the right action to be clear.</p></aside>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section split-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Our point of view</span><h2>Property support should build trust over time.</h2></div><div class="process-grid"><div class="process-step"><h3>Be clear</h3><p>Use plain language and share the context that helps people make decisions.</p></div><div class="process-step"><h3>Be considerate</h3><p>Remember that every property interaction affects someone’s home or livelihood.</p></div><div class="process-step"><h3>Follow through</h3><p>Keep the next step visible and close the loop whenever possible.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <CtaBand title="Let’s start with a conversation." />
</BaseLayout>
